@host = http://localhost:5222

### Cadastro (devolve 201 com o token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### Login (devolve 200 com o token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "password": "senha1234"
}

### Perfil (cole o accessToken retornado acima)
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Trocar a senha (cole o accessToken do login; corpo em snake_case)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/change_password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "old_password": "senha1234",
  "new_password": "novaSenha99"
}
